  /// The alias name.
  pub qualifier: Str? = None
  /// The type of authentication that your function URL uses. Set to AWS_IAM
  /// if you want to restrict access to authenticated users only. Set to NONE
  /// if you want to bypass IAM authentication to create a public endpoint.
  /// For more information, see Control access to Lambda function URLs .
