  /// Invocation results are available when the payload is complete. The
  /// maximum payload size is 6 MB. RESPONSE_STREAM – Your function streams
  /// payload results as they become available. Lambda invokes your function
  /// using the InvokeWithResponseStream API operation. The maximum response
  /// payload size is 200 MB.
  pub invoke_mode: InvokeMode? = None
}

